Current releases should be treated conservatively as GPL-covered
distributions. See PROVENANCE.md for a summary of known file ancestry and
release-compliance notes.

The VerusHash implementation is an ARM NEON translation with the following
upstream ancestry, whose notices must be preserved in redistribution:
 - Verus CLHash variant: Copyright (c) 2018 Michael Toutonghi, based on
   CLHash, Copyright (c) 2017, 2018 Daniel Lemire and Owen Kaser
   (Apache License 2.0; text retained at LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt).
 - Haraka v2: Copyright (c) 2016 kste (MIT License).
